# Product Documentation Index

This directory holds the **non-technical truth** for {{PROJECT_NAME}}: who it is for, what they
need, and what they must be able to do. Nothing in here says how the system is built; that is
`../system/`. A design doc in `../design/` cites a story or requirement here for its why.

